 improvements to the demo, guided by your feedback and suggestions. Expect regular updates, gameplay, and new content!And this demo is here to stay!I plan to continue expanding and improving it with regular updates, with the ultimate goal of offering around hours of enjoyable gameplay.So please keep your feedback coming. Every sugges","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:55:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691253","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5113720-1846651706678232","game_id":"steam-5113720","kind":"announcement","title":"The Siege Begins - EWD Demo Is Here!","summary":"Hey everyone,I’m really excited to share that the Everyone Will Die Demo is now live, just ahead of Steam Next Fest!Everyone Will Die is a dark medieval survival city builder and tower defense game about defending a city that cannot be saved.The enemy surrounds your walls. Food is running out. Your soldiers are exhausted, and there may be no rescue coming.Build defenses, command your dwindling forces, and make increasingly desperate decisions to survive another day. Slaughter horses to feed your","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678232","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5113720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5113720":"2026-10-26T08:23:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5113720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_full